# FaradayOS add-ons list, read by "Install FaradayOS add-ons" (/usr/bin/faraday-addons).
# Nothing here is in the ISO: each add-on downloads only when ticked.
# To add software, add ONE line under its category. Add-ons install in the order listed.
# Categories: a line "[Category name]" starts one; every add-on below it belongs to it.
# "[Category name | performance]" = only in those editions (fedora/editions.list); the ISO build removes the others.
#
#   id | type | what to install | text shown in the checklist | check (optional)
#
#   type dnf      what = Fedora/RPM Fusion package names, space separated   (e.g. obs-studio)
#   type flatpak  what = Flathub app ids, space separated                   (e.g. com.discordapp.Discord)
#   type root     what = a FaradayOS add-on script /usr/libexec/faraday/addon-* (runs as root; give a check)
#   type script   what = installer program to run as the user               (it asks for the password itself)
#   check         shell test that succeeds when already installed. Leave empty for dnf and flatpak:
#                 they count as installed when every package or app in "what" is installed.
#
# dnf, flatpak and root add-ons all install under ONE password prompt, before any script add-on.
# VR goes last because its SteamVR step waits for a Steam download.
[Office and productivity]
onlyoffice  | flatpak | org.onlyoffice.desktopeditors | OnlyOffice: documents, spreadsheets, slides, good Microsoft Office compatibility (Flathub)
wps         | flatpak | com.wps.Office              | WPS Office: Microsoft Office look-alike (proprietary, Flathub)
thunderbird | dnf     | thunderbird                 | Thunderbird: email, calendar and contacts
evolution   | dnf     | evolution evolution-ews     | Evolution: email and calendar, works with Microsoft Exchange and Outlook.com
gnucash     | dnf     | gnucash                     | GnuCash: business and personal accounting
kmymoney    | dnf     | kmymoney                    | KMyMoney: personal finance
homebank    | dnf     | homebank                    | HomeBank: simple budgeting and expenses
zotero      | flatpak | org.zotero.Zotero           | Zotero: collect and cite research sources (Flathub)
joplin      | flatpak | net.cozic.joplin_desktop    | Joplin: notes and to-dos with sync (Flathub)
obsidian    | flatpak | md.obsidian.Obsidian        | Obsidian: notes (Flathub)
logseq      | flatpak | com.logseq.Logseq           | Logseq: outliner notes and knowledge base (Flathub)
planify     | flatpak | io.github.alainm23.planify  | Planify: task manager with Todoist and Nextcloud sync (Flathub)
[CAD and engineering]
freecad     | flatpak | org.freecad.FreeCAD         | FreeCAD: 3D parametric CAD for mechanical design (Flathub)
librecad    | dnf     | librecad                    | LibreCAD: 2D CAD drafting (DXF/DWG)
solvespace  | flatpak | com.solvespace.SolveSpace   | SolveSpace: small, fast parametric 3D CAD (Flathub)
openscad    | dnf     | openscad                    | OpenSCAD: 3D CAD by writing code
dune3d      | flatpak | org.dune3d.dune3d           | Dune 3D: modern parametric 3D CAD (Flathub)
kicad       | dnf     | kicad                       | KiCad: electronics, schematics and circuit boards (large, about 1 GB)
librepcb    | flatpak | org.librepcb.LibrePCB       | LibrePCB: electronics and circuit boards, easy to learn (Flathub)
sweethome3d | flatpak | com.sweethome3d.Sweethome3d | Sweet Home 3D: floor plans and interior design (Flathub)
prusaslicer | dnf     | prusa-slicer                | PrusaSlicer: prepare 3D prints
cura        | flatpak | com.ultimaker.cura          | UltiMaker Cura: prepare 3D prints (Flathub)
[Design, photo and video]
gimp        | dnf     | gimp                        | GIMP: photo editing and retouching
inkscape    | dnf     | inkscape                    | Inkscape: vector graphics, logos, SVG
krita       | dnf     | krita                       | Krita: digital painting and illustration
blender     | dnf     | blender                     | Blender: 3D modelling, animation, rendering
darktable   | dnf     | darktable                   | darktable: RAW photo development and photo library
rawtherapee | dnf     | rawtherapee                 | RawTherapee: RAW photo development
pinta       | flatpak | com.github.PintaProject.Pinta | Pinta: simple image editing, like Paint.NET (Flathub)
scribus     | dnf     | scribus                     | Scribus: page layout, brochures, print design
fontforge   | dnf     | fontforge                   | FontForge: make and edit fonts
kdenlive    | dnf     | kdenlive                    | Kdenlive: video editing
shotcut     | flatpak | org.shotcut.Shotcut         | Shotcut: video editing (Flathub)
handbrake   | flatpak | fr.handbrake.ghb            | HandBrake: convert and shrink videos (Flathub)
audacity    | dnf     | audacity                    | Audacity: audio recording and editing
obs         | dnf     | obs-studio                  | OBS Studio: screen recording and streaming
tidal       | flatpak | com.mastermindzh.tidal-hifi | TIDAL: music streaming, community app tidal-hifi (Flathub)
[Communication]
zoom        | flatpak | us.zoom.Zoom                | Zoom: video meetings (proprietary, Flathub)
teams       | flatpak | com.github.IsmaelMartinez.teams_for_linux | Teams for Linux: Microsoft Teams (community app, Flathub)
