mattermost  | flatpak | com.mattermost.Desktop      | Mattermost: team chat (Flathub)
[PDF and documents]
okular      | dnf     | okular                      | Okular: PDF viewer with notes, highlights and form filling
xournalpp   | dnf     | xournalpp                   | Xournal++: write and sign on PDFs, handwritten notes
pdfarranger | dnf     | pdfarranger                 | PDF Arranger: merge, split, rotate and reorder PDF pages
ocrmypdf    | dnf     | ocrmypdf tesseract-langpack-eng | OCRmyPDF: make scanned PDFs searchable (command line)
calibre     | dnf     | calibre                     | Calibre: e-book library and converter
[Development and AI]
vscode      | flatpak | com.visualstudio.code       | Visual Studio Code: code editor (Flathub)
claudecode  | root    | /usr/libexec/faraday/addon-claude-code | Claude Code: Anthropic's AI coding assistant for the terminal, with git, GitHub CLI, Node.js, uv, ripgrep, jq (official Anthropic repo) | rpm -q claude-code
claudedesk  | root    | /usr/libexec/faraday/addon-claude-desktop | Claude Desktop: Anthropic's Claude app (official Linux beta package, made for Ubuntu; unpacked for FaradayOS) | test -x /usr/bin/claude-desktop
lmstudio    | root    | /usr/libexec/faraday/addon-lmstudio | LM Studio: run AI language models on this PC (download about 500 MB) | test -x /opt/lmstudio/LM-Studio.AppImage
podmandesk  | flatpak | io.podman_desktop.PodmanDesktop | Podman Desktop: containers with a window instead of commands (Flathub)
dbeaver     | flatpak | io.dbeaver.DBeaverCommunity | DBeaver: database tool for SQL, PostgreSQL, MySQL and more (Flathub)
githubdesk  | flatpak | io.github.shiftey.Desktop   | GitHub Desktop: git with a window (community build, Flathub)
meld        | dnf     | meld                        | Meld: compare and merge files and folders
bruno       | flatpak | com.usebruno.Bruno          | Bruno: test web APIs (Flathub)
[Remote access, security and system]
remmina     | dnf     | remmina remmina-plugins-rdp remmina-plugins-vnc | Remmina: remote desktop (RDP, VNC)
rustdesk    | flatpak | com.rustdesk.RustDesk       | RustDesk: remote support, like TeamViewer (Flathub)
anydesk     | flatpak | com.anydesk.Anydesk         | AnyDesk: remote support (proprietary, Flathub)
winboat     | root    | /usr/libexec/faraday/addon-winboat | WinBoat: Windows apps in a small Windows VM (needs virtualization on, 4 GB+ RAM) | rpm -q winboat
wine        | dnf     | wine lutris                 | Wine and Lutris: run Windows programs and non-Steam games (about 0.5 GB)
bitwarden   | flatpak | com.bitwarden.desktop       | Bitwarden: password manager (Flathub)
keepassxc   | dnf     | keepassxc                   | KeePassXC: offline password manager
nextcloud   | dnf     | nextcloud-client            | Nextcloud: sync files with a Nextcloud server
syncthing   | dnf     | syncthing                   | Syncthing: sync folders between your own devices
kdeconnect  | dnf     | kde-connect                 | KDE Connect: phone and PC together (files, notifications, clipboard)
qbittorrent | dnf     | qbittorrent                 | qBittorrent: torrent downloads
timeshift   | dnf     | timeshift                   | Timeshift: system snapshots, roll back after a bad update
gnomedisks  | dnf     | gnome-disk-utility          | GNOME Disks: format, check and image disks and USB sticks
popsicle    | flatpak | com.system76.Popsicle       | Popsicle: write one ISO to several USB sticks at once (Flathub)
flatseal    | flatpak | com.github.tchx84.Flatseal  | Flatseal: manage Flathub app permissions (Flathub)
fingerprint | dnf     | fprintd fprintd-pam libfprint | Fingerprint readers: drivers (fprintd, libfprint) and fingerprint login
[Gaming and VR | performance]
heroic      | flatpak | com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl | Heroic Games Launcher: Epic, GOG and Amazon games (Flathub)
protonupqt  | flatpak | net.davidotek.pupgui2       | ProtonUp-Qt: install Proton-GE and other Proton/Wine versions (Flathub)
ckan        | root    | /usr/libexec/faraday/addon-ckan | CKAN: mod manager for Kerbal Space Program | rpm -q ckan
vr          | script  | /usr/bin/faraday-install-vr | VR tools: WiVRn, ALVR and SteamVR (download about 0.5 to 1 GB) | rpm -q wivrn wivrn-dashboard && test -x /opt/alvr/bin/alvr_dashboard && ls "$HOME"/.local/share/Steam/steamapps/common/SteamVR/bin/linux64/vrcompositor-launcher "$HOME"/.steam/steam/steamapps/common/SteamVR/bin/linux64/vrcompositor-launcher
